# The compiled engine's build artefacts (python3 tools/build_fast.py, pip install .): the
# generated C, the annotation HTML, the extension modules and setuptools' build folder are
# never committed; the .pyx and .pxd sources beside them are.
python/tabletop/_native/*.c
python/tabletop/_native/*.html
python/tabletop/_native/*.so
python/tabletop/_native/*.pyd
python/build/
python/*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
